Z||000009||StuGood||11-15-2000||09:02 AM||||Ouch.  Was hoping it wouldn't come to this.  Don't know (firsthand) anything about transaxle replacement, but my understanding is that 5-speed Isuzus are fairly easy to find, in the salvage yards.  Probably okay, if engine is a 4-cyl., and less downtime than rebuilding the 4-speed (I think!).<P>Might do a search, and see if someone else has already done such a trans. swap - see if there are linkage issues, etc. Wouldn't throw away that 4-speed, though, in any case.  Just a few rambling thoughts, for what they're worth.  Good luck with it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||9
